    "updateTime": "2026-11-23T11:30:00+08:00",
    "generalSituationZh": "受東北季候風及一道廣闊雲帶影響，明日廣東沿岸地區有雨，天氣逐步轉涼，隨後一兩日早晚清涼。隨著東北季候風緩和及雲帶轉薄，本週後期該區天色逐漸好轉，氣溫回升。預料一股較乾燥的東北季候風補充會在週末期間影響華南沿岸，該區日夜溫差頗大。",
    "generalSituationEn": "Under the influence of the northeast monsoon and a broad band of clouds, there will be rain and it will become cool progressively over the coastal areas of Guangdong tomorrow. It will be cool in the morning and at night in the following couple of days. With the northeast monsoon moderating and the band of clouds thinning out, the weather will improve gradually over the region in the latter part of this week and temperatures will rise. A relatively dry replenishment of the northeast monsoon is expected to affect the coast of southern China over the weekend. The temperature difference between day and night will be rather large over the region.",
